  triage:title "heartbeat_message_key returns Result<MessageKey, AtmError> with structurally unreachable Err variant" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/peer_transport.rs:670: heartbeat_message_key returns Result<MessageKey, AtmError> but the Err variant is structurally unreachable. Invariant comment was added during W.4 fix but the return type was not simplified. Best practice (Infallible pattern): simplify to return MessageKey directly (or use Result<MessageKey, Infallible> as intermediate step), removing the misleading error path." ;
